/* 本周小目标（Figma 648:1186）：四步竹节编号；选择块；SMART 一句话目标；保存后进入记录。 */
page {
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.goal-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 16rpx var(--p3-page-x) calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: var(--p3-paper);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.goal-intro {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.goal-step {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  min-width: 0;
}

.goal-step__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.goal-step__joint {
  width: 16rpx;
  height: 36rpx;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: var(--p3-primary);
}

.goal-step__number {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.goal-step__title {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 32rpx;
  line-height: 48rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.goal-chips {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.goal-save {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.goal-save__status {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}
